desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Var In Href"
	title_zh: "检测到Var In Href",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-var-in-href"
	risk: "xss"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Detected a template variable used in an anchor tag with the 'href' attribute. This allows a malicious actor to input the 'javascript:' URI and is subject to cross- site scripting (XSS) attacks. If using a relative URL, start with a literal forward slash and concatenate the URL, like this: href='/<%= link %>'. You may also consider setting the Content Security Policy (CSP) header.

### 风险类型
跨站脚本（XSS）（xss）

### 影响
未正确转义或过滤用户输入，攻击者可在页面中注入并执行恶意脚本。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-79: Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation ('Cross-site Scripting')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
对输出进行上下文相关的转义，使用安全的模板 API，并启用 CSP 等防护。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.ejs": <<<POS
<a"sy[0 utL&88 ""Q<href
		
=YJM(8q<%%>6;[>

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.ejs}.pattern_regex(/<a.*href\s*=[^>]*?[^\/&=]<%.*?%>.*?>/) as $p0
${*.html}.pattern_regex(/<a.*href\s*=[^>]*?[^\/&=]<%.*?%>.*?>/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Var In Href",
	title_zh: "检测到Var In Href",
	message: "Var In Href",
}
